C1 — adapters/file_storage_adapter scaffold, wired into the uv workspace. Found a real pytest/mypy collision immediately: two files both named test_scaffold.py in different packages collide as bare top-level modules. Fixed by uniquely naming each adapter's scaffold test (test_file_storage_adapter_scaffold.py), not by changing import mode (that broke _helpers.py's existing pattern when I tried it).
