| `uvicorn` | [PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/uvicorn/) | *pin at adoption* | ASGI server running the FastAPI apps above. | Standard companion to FastAPI; widely adopted. | 2026-08-23 |
| `httpx` | [PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/httpx/) | *pin at adoption* | Async outbound HTTP for the HTTP Adapter and Webhook Sender (Phase 3) — a distinct future use from `httpx2` below. | Maintained by Encode (same org as `starlette`/`uvicorn`); widely adopted. | 2026-08-23 |
| `httpx2` | [PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/httpx2/) | **2.12.0** (resolved via `uv add --dev`) | `starlette`'s `TestClient` (used by [test_webhook_listener_app.py](adapters/webhook_listener/tests/test_webhook_listener_app.py), Step D3) requires it — a plain `httpx` install works too but logs a `StarletteDeprecationWarning` telling you to install this instead (confirmed by testing, not assumed); a genuinely separate PyPI package from `httpx`, not a version bump, presumably to let both coexist during `starlette`'s migration. Shared dev-group dependency — every future FastAPI-based adapter's tests need the same thing. | New package (backs `httpx`'s own ecosystem, same maintainers as `starlette`/`fastapi` depend on) — low risk, but young; `pip-audit`: no known vulnerabilities. | 2026-08-27 |
