534:- [ ] **D3. HTTP endpoint** — `POST /webhooks/{path:path}` (Decision #22): verify `X-Webhook-Secret`, reject with `401` on mismatch/missing before touching the bus at all, read the raw body, base64-encode into `{"path": ..., "content": ...}`, publish `events.files.FileWriteRequested` via `BusClient` (fire-and-forget per the manifest's own description — respond `202 Accepted` once published, not once processed). A `GET /healthz` for Compose/manual liveness checks, since — per A6/A7's finding — not every image in this stack ships a usable shell/HTTP client for that; a Python-native ASGI app can trivially serve its own.
