605:- [ ] **F1. Schemas** — `schemas/events.files.FileReadRequested.v1.json`/`FileReadCompleted`, `FileListRequested`/`FileListCompleted`, `FileDeleteRequested`/`FileDeleteCompleted`, and one shared `FileOperationFailed.v1.json` (Decision #23), mirroring Step C3's approach and the existing write-path schemas' style exactly.
