607:- [ ] **F3. `list_handler.py`** — subscribes to `FileListRequested` (`{"path"}`, the directory to list — empty string means `watch_dir` itself), publishes `FileListCompleted` (`{"path", "entries": [{"name", "isDirectory", "sizeBytes"}]}`), non-recursive (Decision #23). `FileOperationFailed` if `path` doesn't exist or isn't a directory.
608:- [ ] **F4. `delete_handler.py`** — subscribes to `FileDeleteRequested` (`{"path"}`), publishes `FileDeleteCompleted` (`{"path"}`) or `FileOperationFailed` (`{"path", "operation": "delete", "reason": "not_found"}`).
