Is there a way to configure dependabot to open PRs against `develop` branch instead of main?
Yes — each updates entry supports a target-branch key. Without it, Dependabot opens PRs against the repo's default branch (which is presumably main here); setting it explicitly points PRs at develop instead, matching this project's own branching model (in-progress work → develop, main reserved for production).

