- [ ] `__main__.py` — `run()` split from `main()`
- [ ] `schemas/events.<context>.<Type>.v1.json` for every new event type, plus a schema test
- [ ] `infra/nats/adapter_identities.yaml` entry (+ a `-test` twin) — applied via `infra/nats/up.sh`
